        "node_id": "n_5_c596c9",
        "thought_text": "Use a binary search combined with a greedy strategy to find the optimal number of problems to solve each day. Start with an initial guess for the number of problems per day and adjust based on whether the total profit meets the criteria. This method balances the need for efficiency and accuracy.",
