        "node_id": "n_6_d9764e",
        "thought_text": "Refine the greedy algorithm by prioritizing the placement of high-difficulty problems early in their respective segments. This ensures that the maximum difficulty for each day is as high as possible, leading to a higher overall total profit. Adjust the algorithm to backtrack and explore alternative placements if the initial solution is not optimal.",
