        "node_id": "n_7_00dbd8",
        "thought_text": "Re-evaluate the dynamic programming approach to ensure the correct calculation of the maximum profit and the corresponding segment sizes. Verify that the transition between states correctly captures the maximum difficulty within each segment.",
