        "node_id": "n_9_6c7e7d",
        "thought_text": "Implement a backtracking solution to explore all possible ways to divide the problems into k segments and keep track of the maximum total profit. Although this might be computationally expensive, it could serve as a reference to validate the correctness of the dynamic programming solution.",
