        "thought_text": "Implement a greedy approach to partition the problems. Start by iterating through the list of problems and assigning them to days in a way that maximizes the daily profit. This could involve keeping track of the current day's maximum difficulty and starting a new day when the addition of another problem would decrease the overall profit.",
